.TH MOXY-ADD 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy-add \- Interactively add a server to a moxyfile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy add
.RI [ --path = STRING ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a terminal form to configure a new MCP server entry (name, command, annotations) and appends it to the specified moxyfile.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --path
Path to the moxyfile to modify
Default: moxyfile
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy (1)
